<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav November PPI up 1.2 pct, yr/yr 65.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav November PPI up 1.2 pct, yr/yr 65.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV PRODUCER PRICES   Nov 96    Oct 96	Nov 95</p>
<p> monthly PPI index rise     +  1.2    +  1.5	  n.a.</p>
<p> yr/yr change		   + 65.9    + 68.0	  n.a.</p>
<p> change vs average 1995     +106.5    +104.1	+101.0</p>
<p>NOTES -- November producer prices rose 42.4 percent against December 1995.</p>
<p>Cummulative January-November PPI was up 95.4 percent against the same eleven-month period last year and 87.4-percent above the average for 1995.</p>
<p>-- Amra Kevic, Belgrade newsroom +381 11 2224305</p>
</text>
